  - I thought you were gone, where have you been?
  - ...good to know SGT Peppers is alright.
  - Sadly me and AI got seperated, but i saw them taking her to the study desk.
  - You are probably going to rescue her right? Here. Have this. Im sure it will
    come in handy.
  - Be careful, i will see you later.
